# The build context is the repository root, but the Dockerfile only ever COPYs
# entrypoint.sh and flyway-callbacks/. Stated as an allowlist rather than a list
# of things to exclude: a denylist has to grow with every new file at the root
# — a linter config, an agent's scratch directory — and nothing signals when one
# is forgotten, whereas anything missing from this list fails the COPY loudly.
*
!entrypoint.sh
!flyway-callbacks
